{%- comment -%}
  Web Template: Apprentice Sign-Up (multi-step form)
  ---------------------------------------------------
  Paste this whole file into Power Pages Studio as a Web Template
  (or a page's "Edit code" panel if attaching directly to one page),
  then assign it as the Page Template for your Sign-Up page.

  BEFORE GOING LIVE:
  1. Create the bnsw_apprenticesignup table using dataverse-table-schema.csv
     (rename the bnsw_ prefix below to match your solution's actual publisher prefix).
  2. Add a Table Permission for bnsw_apprenticesignup scoped to this website
     (Contact/Global as appropriate — see security-and-permissions.md).
  3. Add a site setting named  Webapi/bnsw_apprenticesignup/enabled  with value  true
     (Power Pages Web API only exposes tables you explicitly enable).
  4. Add a site setting named  Webapi/bnsw_apprenticesignup/fields  listing the columns
     this page writes (see security-and-permissions.md) — this is REQUIRED, not optional.
  5. Confirm the table's entity set name (Table properties > plural logical name) —
     update ENTITY_SET below if it differs from "bnsw_apprenticesignups".
  6. Confirm CONTACT_NAV below matches the Contact lookup's navigation property name
     (the lookup column's *schema* name, case-sensitive, e.g. bnsw_Contact).
  7. Tracking-code check (no sign-in): the page only shows the form for a tracking code
     that exists in the bnsw_signupinvite table with status Issued and not expired.
     Run Enable-TrackingCodeCheck.ps1 and follow TRACKING-CODE-CHECK.md. The page must
     be open to everyone (no page permission); anonymous visitors need Read on
     bnsw_signupinvite (for the check below) and Create on bnsw_apprenticesignup.
     Do NOT enable the Web API for bnsw_signupinvite.
  8. Pre-fill (optional): run Enable-Prefill.ps1 BEFORE pasting this template - the code
     check reads the invite's bnsw_prefilldata column. See PREFILL.md.

  Applicants get a personal link from their sign-up email:
     https://<your-site>/<page-path>?trackingcode=ABC123
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} ---- Settings ----
  asa_logo_url     : address of the ASA logo image (upload it as a Web File, or copy the image
                     address from the ASA website). Leave '' to use the ASA logo built into this template.
  asa_privacy_url  : privacy policy link shown in the footer. Leave '' to hide.
  asa_use_webfont  : true loads the Figtree font from Google Fonts (closest match to the ASA
                     website). false uses the device's own font, with no external calls.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign asa_logo_url = '' -%}
{%- assign asa_privacy_url = 'https://www.apprenticeshipsupport.com.au/privacy-policy' -%}
{%- assign asa_use_webfont = true -%}
